<Project>
  <!-- Empty on purpose. Its only job is to stop the upward MSBuild walk so a consumer's own
       repository-root Directory.Build.props (TreatWarningsAsErrors, custom analyzers, whatever
       else) cannot reach into the engine's trust-critical build. Measured: without a stopper file
       here, an ordinary consumer repository silently reshapes the packaged engine's compile. -->
</Project>
